OL,3,ABonfire Night policing will be 'largest
OL,4,Aoperation since Trump visit'
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's biggest police operation
OL,7,Fsince the visit of President Donald
OL,8,FTrump last year is to take place on
OL,9,FBonfire Night, in the face of a
OL,10,F"unique" combination of safety
OL,11,Fconcerns.
OL,13,FAs many as 1,700 officers could be
OL,14,Fdeployed on and around 5 November to
OL,15,Fdeal with fireworks-related disorder, a
OL,16,FEuropean football match involving
OL,17,FCeltic and potential protests in
OL,18,FGlasgow.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
