OL,3,ABonfire Night policing will be 'largest
OL,4,Aoperation since Trump visit'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdditional public order vehicles and
OL,7,Fdrivers are being brought in from 18
OL,8,FEnglish and Welsh police forces under
OL,9,Fmutual aid arrangements.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland says the plan, titled
OL,12,FOperation Amberlight, is intended to
OL,13,Fensure the safety of the public and
OL,14,Femergency services.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
